♪ Never speaking the truth ♪

14
00:58.320 --> 00:59.600
How shameless.

15
01:00.360 --> 01:01.480
Only 119 days left.

16
01:01.800 --> 01:03.080
I guess I'll endure it.

17
01:03.080 --> 01:04.400
Do whatever you want.

18
01:07.480 --> 01:08.840
Please get out of my room.

19
01:08.840 --> 01:10.480
You're quick to throw me out.

20
01:10.480 --> 01:11.800
If it were Smith...

21
01:18.080 --> 01:19.760
So you really don't want me anymore?

22
05:16.480 --> 05:19.000
CONSIDER THIS YOUR FEE

23
05:51.360 --> 05:53.159
ONG

24
05:58.840 --> 06:00.160
Hey, Ong.

25
06:00.320 --> 06:01.160
Oh!

26
06:01.160 --> 06:02.480
Mom had a fever this evening.

27
06:02.800 --> 06:03.960
I gave her medicine

28
06:03.960 --> 06:05.360
and wiped her down,

29
06:05.720 --> 06:07.200
the fever just wouldn't go down

30
06:07.200 --> 06:08.480
It was almost 40 degrees.

31
06:09.680 --> 06:11.400
I've brought her to the hospital now,

32
06:11.400 --> 06:12.800
and the doctor wants to admit her.

33
06:13.200 --> 06:14.360
How did Mom get sick?

34
06:15.080 --> 06:16.320
She probably

35
06:16.320 --> 06:17.640
got caught in the rain

36
06:17.640 --> 06:19.120
when she was helping me bring in the laundry.

37
06:20.440 --> 06:22.240
Oh, I'm sorry.

38
06:23.000 --> 06:24.200
I couldn't stop her in time.

39
06:24.960 --> 06:26.160
It's okay, Ong. It's okay.

40
06:26.720 --> 06:27.920
Oh,

41
06:28.320 --> 06:30.160
do you have any money?

42
06:31.800 --> 06:33.600
What you gave me

43
06:33.600 --> 06:34.760
might not be enough.

44
06:45.880 --> 06:46.920
I do,

45
06:48.400 --> 06:49.640
but it's in cash.

46
06:51.720 --> 06:52.760
I'll take care of it.

47
06:53.840 --> 06:54.840
Okay.

48
06:55.600 --> 06:56.600
Go look after Mom.

49
06:57.520 --> 06:59.320
Keep me updated on what the doctor says.

50
06:59.520 --> 07:00.520
Yes.

51
07:27.640 --> 07:29.640
Bua, if you're done, you can go rest.

52
07:29.640 --> 07:30.640
Got it.

53
07:34.840 --> 07:35.960
Cream,

54
07:36.240 --> 07:37.240
are you free?

55
07:37.240 --> 07:39.000
I need to talk to you about something.

56
07:40.400 --> 07:41.400
Yeah,

57
07:41.920 --> 07:43.040
sure.

58
07:43.520 --> 07:45.159
I need to transfer some money

59
07:45.159 --> 07:46.320
to my sister urgently.

60
07:47.080 --> 07:48.480
May I have permission to leave?

61
07:48.480 --> 07:49.600
Go out at this hour?

62
07:50.000 --> 07:51.040
It's late, Oh.

63
07:51.560 --> 07:52.960
Want me to wire it for you?

64
07:56.240 --> 07:57.320
What do you say?

65
08:00.720 --> 08:01.800
Yeah,

66
08:01.800 --> 08:02.680
sorry to trouble you.

67
08:03.120 --> 08:04.200
Here's 30,000 baht.

68
08:04.200 --> 08:05.400
Count it first.

69
08:05.920 --> 08:06.920
Wow,

70
08:07.520 --> 08:09.680
why are you carrying so much cash?

71
08:17.320 --> 08:18.600
Send me the account number.

72
08:29.720 --> 08:30.720
Okay, done.

73
08:30.720 --> 08:31.680
Thanks.

74
08:39.960 --> 08:41.240
Hey, Cream,

75
08:42.520 --> 08:44.080
is Ms. Song staying here tonight?

76
08:45.080 --> 08:46.080
Probably.

77
08:46.360 --> 08:47.840
I saw her working in her study.

78
08:48.840 --> 08:49.840
Is something up?

79
08:50.880 --> 08:51.920
Nothing.

80
08:52.360 --> 08:53.360
Thanks.

81
09:03.600 --> 09:04.640
What is this?

82
09:07.280 --> 09:08.360
It's paper.

83
09:08.800 --> 09:09.960
Don't you know what it is?

84
09:10.800 --> 09:12.240
What does it mean?

85
09:13.200 --> 09:14.400
It means what it says.

86
09:17.200 --> 09:19.400
Then what happened earlier between us?

87
09:21.280 --> 09:22.240
And when you said,

88
09:22.520 --> 09:24.240
"So you really don't want me anymore?"

89
09:24.440 --> 09:25.440
Why did you say that?

90
09:30.440 --> 09:31.600
I was just in the mood.

91
09:32.160 --> 09:33.680
I wanted to see if you'd join in.

92
09:35.200 --> 09:36.360
Why?

93
09:36.360 --> 09:37.440
You questioned this,

94
09:38.080 --> 09:40.080
but not the money I left you?

95
09:44.520 --> 09:45.560
Where is the money?

96
09:53.320 --> 09:54.680
You already took it, didn't you?

97
09:57.320 --> 09:58.600
Why are you like this?

98
10:01.240 --> 10:02.360
You should be glad.

99
10:02.920 --> 10:04.960
I paid you far more than other women.

100
10:06.160 --> 10:07.160
You know,

101
10:07.720 --> 10:09.400
A used item

102
10:09.560 --> 10:11.400
shouldn't even cost this much.

103
10:13.120 --> 10:14.560
I've even thrown in an extra.

104
10:18.480 --> 10:19.840
You're not the Song I knew.

105
10:22.240 --> 10:23.400
The Song you knew?

106
10:23.920 --> 10:25.040
That idiot?

107
10:27.520 --> 10:29.240
I'd never be fooled twice.

108
10:31.880 --> 10:32.960
What?

109
10:33.400 --> 10:35.040
Wasn't what I gave you enough?

110
10:35.920 --> 10:36.920
Want more?

111
10:38.960 --> 10:40.120
Maybe another round?

112
10:40.520 --> 10:41.760
I can get myself going again.

113
10:51.880 --> 10:53.280
I'm sorry, Ms. Kasira.

114
10:55.160 --> 10:57.120
I thought I had met someone familiar.

115
10:59.400 --> 11:01.160
Sorry for mistaking you for someone else.

116
11:04.520 --> 11:05.640
I'm truly sorry.

117
11:06.200 --> 11:10.680
♪ But my mouth denies my heart ♪

118
11:10.680 --> 11:12.560
♪ Never speaking the truth ♪

119
11:12.560 --> 11:17.680
♪ Even though everything I do ♪

120
11:17.680 --> 11:21.000
♪ Is telling you I love you ♪

121
11:21.000 --> 11:25.000
♪ I give in every time our eyes meet ♪

122
11:25.280 --> 11:33.240
♪ But I'm unable to show it ♪

123
11:33.240 --> 11:40.960
♪ I want to say "I love you" for once, Just like how I feel ♪

124
11:44.640 --> 11:45.640
Uttawadee,

125
11:46.640 --> 11:47.840
this is only the beginning.

126
12:14.240 --> 12:19.120
