131
12:36.800 --> 12:39.880
♪ Not wanting them to come out ♪

132
12:39.880 --> 12:43.160
♪ But the closer we get ♪

133
12:43.160 --> 12:47.120
♪ The more my heart wavers ♪

134
12:47.480 --> 12:51.960
♪ I want to surrender to every voice in my heart ♪

135
12:51.960 --> 12:54.200
♪ But my mouth denies my heart... ♪

136
13:01.640 --> 13:02.640
Ms. Cream!

137
13:03.280 --> 13:04.560
Mr. Sam is here!

138
13:05.200 --> 13:06.160
Mr. Sam?

139
13:06.160 --> 13:07.200
Yes.

140
13:12.800 --> 13:14.040
This is for my mother.

141
13:14.640 --> 13:16.280
This is for you and the rest.

142
13:24.680 --> 13:25.680
Take these too.

143
13:34.160 --> 13:34.880
Mr. Sam.

144
13:34.880 --> 13:35.920
Well,

145
13:36.400 --> 13:37.560
how is my mother?

146
13:38.400 --> 13:39.600
I'll go see her.

147
13:42.160 --> 13:43.200
What are you doing?

148
13:43.520 --> 13:44.520
Mr. Sam.

149
13:45.000 --> 13:46.720
We've got a new nurse.

150
13:46.720 --> 13:48.120
More importantly,

151
13:48.120 --> 13:49.800
she's Dr. Smith's girlfriend.

152
13:50.160 --> 13:51.960
No causing trouble this time, okay?

153
13:52.400 --> 13:53.600
Dr. Smith's girlfriend?

154
13:54.320 --> 13:55.360
Are they planning

155
13:55.360 --> 13:56.320
to move the whole family here?

156
13:56.320 --> 13:57.040
Mr. Sam!

157
13:57.040 --> 13:58.160
I know!

158
14:13.560 --> 14:14.560
What is it, Cream?

159
14:14.760 --> 14:16.000
Mr. Sarttra,

160
14:16.000 --> 14:17.480
Mr. Sam is here.

161
14:18.440 --> 14:20.000
I'll tell Ms. Song first.

162
14:21.800 --> 14:23.200
"According to English custom,

163
14:23.480 --> 14:25.760
everyone, noble or commoner,

164
14:26.080 --> 14:28.000
walks into the wedding ceremony

165
14:28.000 --> 14:29.320
to the same music.

166
14:29.320 --> 14:30.920
The rest of the ceremony

167
14:30.920 --> 14:32.560
is also modeled as closely as possible

168
14:32.560 --> 14:33.560
on the same pattern."

169
14:35.520 --> 14:36.960
Hey, Mom!

170
14:37.440 --> 14:38.560
How have you been?

171
14:46.280 --> 14:47.360
Here you are, ma'am.

172
14:56.720 --> 14:57.760
Sam!

173
14:58.360 --> 14:59.400
Yes, it's me.

174
14:59.880 --> 15:01.560
I missed you so much!

175
15:01.560 --> 15:03.240
How are you?

176
15:03.720 --> 15:05.240
Did you just get back, dear?

177
15:05.240 --> 15:06.280
Yes.

178
15:06.280 --> 15:07.920
- Are you hungry? - Not yet.

179
15:08.240 --> 15:09.280
Are you tired?

180
15:09.480 --> 15:10.480
Not at all.

181
15:11.320 --> 15:12.920
My, how clingy you are.

182
15:13.360 --> 15:14.840
You're all grown up now.

183
15:15.360 --> 15:16.920
Grown-ups can be clingy too.

184
15:19.640 --> 15:20.840
Ms. Song,

185
15:21.480 --> 15:22.640
Cream just called.

186
15:22.640 --> 15:24.120
Mr. Sam is back at the house.

187
15:29.480 --> 15:30.600
Let him.

188
15:30.600 --> 15:32.240
Sam probably missed Mom too.

189
15:34.800 --> 15:36.120
What's on the schedule today?

190
15:38.160 --> 15:39.240
At 1 p.m.,

191
15:39.240 --> 15:41.080
two event organizers are coming in

192
15:41.080 --> 15:42.800
to pitch their proposal for the new collection's launch event.

193
15:43.080 --> 15:44.160
Would you like to sit in

194
15:44.160 --> 15:45.200
on the presentation?

195
15:45.480 --> 15:47.160
I can. I'm not tied up.

196
15:48.880 --> 15:50.080
So where's the proposal?

197
15:50.600 --> 15:51.720
Proposal?

198
15:51.960 --> 15:53.040
Uh,

199
15:53.480 --> 15:54.440
sure.

200
15:54.440 --> 15:55.520
I'll go get it for you.

201
15:58.320 --> 15:59.880
She's going to read the proposal herself?

202
16:40.760 --> 16:41.840
Okay.

203
16:41.840 --> 16:42.840
Wow!

204
16:47.120 --> 16:48.080
Here it is.

205
16:48.680 --> 16:49.920
That looks delicious.

206
16:55.120 --> 16:57.600
See, I know exactly what you like, Mom.

207
17:06.240 --> 17:07.240
Ms. Song.

208
17:12.520 --> 17:13.520
The proposal.

209
17:31.960 --> 17:33.000
Wouldn't it be better

210
17:33.880 --> 17:35.080
if you went home first?

211
17:36.320 --> 17:37.560
These documents

212
17:38.480 --> 17:39.640
can be signed tomorrow.

213
17:41.200 --> 17:42.240
What's with you?

214
17:42.480 --> 17:44.440
I'm sitting in on the presentation at 1 p.m.

215
17:44.440 --> 17:45.520
How can I go home first?

216
17:46.560 --> 17:47.880
But Mr. Sam is at the house.

217
17:48.680 --> 17:49.880
So what?

218
17:51.320 --> 17:52.320
All right.

219
18:38.960 --> 18:39.960
This is number eight.

220
18:40.400 --> 18:41.240
Number eight?

221
18:41.240 --> 18:42.240
Yes.

222
19:15.080 --> 19:16.440
You're so good, Mom!

223
19:18.960 --> 19:20.240
Are you sleepy now, ma'am?

224
19:21.200 --> 19:22.080
Yes.

225
19:22.640 --> 19:24.640
How about lying down?

226
19:24.960 --> 19:25.840
Mm-hmm.

227
19:25.840 --> 19:26.760
Sure.

228
19:29.320 --> 19:30.320
Let me help.

229
19:35.480 --> 19:36.480
Thanks.

230
19:36.920 --> 19:37.800
I've got it.

231
19:40.360 --> 19:41.800
Careful, please.

232
19:43.960 --> 19:44.960
All done.

233
19:45.280 --> 19:46.400
Lean back slowly.

234
19:48.120 --> 19:49.000
Okay.

235
19:49.000 --> 19:50.000
Thanks.

236
19:52.200 --> 19:53.560
I'll read a book for you.

237
19:55.120 --> 19:56.040
Sure.

238
20:05.640 --> 20:06.640
Hello.

239
20:07.960 --> 20:08.800
Yes.

240
20:08.800 --> 20:10.400
I'll have someone come down to get it.

241
20:12.200 --> 20:13.720
Cream, a food delivery is here.

242
20:13.720 --> 20:15.480
Could you go down and pick it up?

243
20:15.480 --> 20:16.600
What did you order?

244
20:16.600 --> 20:18.200
We haven't even finished what you bought.

245
20:18.200 --> 20:19.880
I ordered for Mom, Nueng, Song,

246
20:19.880 --> 20:21.080
and everyone.

247
20:21.680 --> 20:22.920
Hurry down, okay?

248
20:23.120 --> 20:24.760
The rider's already waiting outside.

249
20:26.720 --> 20:27.880
Yes, I'll go right now.

250
20:29.000 --> 20:30.360
I'll go get the book first.

251
20:33.360 --> 20:34.280
Go on.

252
21:02.360 --> 21:03.360
Mr. Sam.

253
21:05.800 --> 21:07.120
You can go down and eat first.

254
21:07.480 --> 21:08.880
I'll look after Mom myself.

255
21:09.520 --> 21:10.560
Are you sure?

256
21:12.960 --> 21:13.880
All right then.

257
21:14.840 --> 21:16.120
Oh, let's go down.

258
21:16.120 --> 21:17.440
Mr. Sam ordered so much.

259
21:18.200 --> 21:19.240
You go ahead, Cream.

260
21:19.480 --> 21:20.760
I'll just tidy up here first.

261
21:21.760 --> 21:23.200
"According to English custom,

262
21:23.200 --> 21:26.120
everyone, noble or commoner,

263
21:26.440 --> 21:28.760
walks into the wedding ceremony

264
21:28.760 --> 21:30.720
to the same music."

265
21:46.960 --> 21:47.880
Ms. Oh.

266
21:49.680 --> 21:51.280
- Yes? - Do you have any painkillers?

267
21:51.840 --> 21:53.440
What's wrong, Mr. Sam?

268
21:54.200 --> 21:55.400
I have a headache.

269
21:55.560 --> 21:56.880
It's probably a migraine.

270
21:57.680 --> 21:59.320
What do you usually take?

271
22:06.600 --> 22:07.600
This one.

272
22:09.920 --> 22:11.080
I think we might have it.

273
22:11.560 --> 22:13.080
I'll go and check for you.

274
22:42.320 --> 22:43.440
Did you find it?

275
22:44.800 --> 22:45.840
No, I didn't.

276
22:46.920 --> 22:48.800
I'll go ask Ms. Cream

277
22:48.800 --> 22:51.000
