278
22:54.800 --> 22:55.840
Never mind.

279
22:56.320 --> 22:57.400
If we don't have that one,

280
22:58.800 --> 23:00.080
there's still something else

281
23:00.080 --> 23:01.440
that can cure a headache.

282
23:01.440 --> 23:02.480
Mr. Sam, let go!

283
23:06.560 --> 23:08.080
What perfume do you wear?

284
23:08.080 --> 23:09.040
You smell so good.

285
23:09.280 --> 23:10.120
Let me go!

286
23:10.120 --> 23:11.120
Let go!

287
23:11.360 --> 23:12.520
Let me go!

288
23:17.480 --> 23:18.480
Oww!

289
23:22.280 --> 23:23.960
You like it rough, huh?

290
23:31.160 --> 23:32.160
Let go!

291
23:44.760 --> 23:45.920
Song!

292
23:46.760 --> 23:48.400
Did you really have to hit me?

293
23:48.600 --> 23:49.640
I'll do even more

294
23:49.640 --> 23:51.760
