295
23:53.520 --> 23:54.560
Fine.

296
23:54.840 --> 23:56.360
If you keep taking other people's side

297
23:56.360 --> 23:57.560
over your own brother's,

298
23:57.560 --> 23:58.800
I'll get even worse!

299
24:15.160 --> 24:16.280
He hasn't changed at all.

300
24:53.800 --> 24:54.880
It's okay.

301
26:13.440 --> 26:14.480
Aside from here,

302
26:14.680 --> 26:16.040
