303
26:28.520 --> 26:29.560
It's okay.

304
26:30.760 --> 26:31.840
Don't cry.

305
26:47.440 --> 26:48.440
About the job...

306
26:49.680 --> 26:50.640
I think...

307
26:54.520 --> 26:55.680
About the job...

308
26:57.040 --> 26:58.240
You don't need to worry.

309
27:00.440 --> 27:02.080
I'll do my best.

310
27:03.960 --> 27:05.080
I've been through a lot.

311
27:11.560 --> 27:12.880
Been through a lot?

312
27:15.080 --> 27:16.360
Maybe

313
27:16.360 --> 27:17.480
I shouldn't have interrupted Sam,

314
27:17.840 --> 27:19.680
