315
27:21.480 --> 27:22.560
You don't seem shaken

316
27:22.560 --> 27:23.640
anyway.

317
27:35.040 --> 27:36.080
Please move.

318
27:37.240 --> 27:38.720
I'm going to look after Madam.

319
27:50.800 --> 27:55.320
♪ I want to tell you so you'll understand ♪

320
