341
29:37.600 --> 29:44.960
♪ I want to say "I love you" for once, Just like how I feel ♪

342
29:49.840 --> 29:53.880
♪ But I'm unable to show it ♪

343
29:53.880 --> 30:01.240
♪ I want to say "I love you" for once, Just like how I feel ♪

344
30:01.840 --> 30:03.640
Is this position comfortable?

345
30:04.320 --> 30:05.320
Yes, dear.

346
30:06.840 --> 30:08.520
Shall I adjust anything else?

347
30:08.520 --> 30:10.200
No need. It's fine.

348
30:18.040 --> 30:19.160
Hello, Mom.

349
30:21.280 --> 30:23.560
Guess who this is, ma'am?

350
30:27.640 --> 30:28.680
Nueng, of course.

351
30:31.280 --> 30:32.480
That's right, Mom.

352
30:32.640 --> 30:33.640
It's Nueng.

353
30:34.840 --> 30:36.000
How pretty you are.

354
30:40.000 --> 30:41.440
It's time for your meal.

355
30:43.360 --> 30:44.680
Have you eaten, Nueng?

356
30:45.520 --> 30:46.840
I've finished already.

357
30:47.120 --> 30:48.040
You go ahead and eat.

358
30:59.240 --> 31:00.360
Ms. Oh,

359
31:03.520 --> 31:04.960
can you come here, please?

360
31:13.760 --> 31:14.760
First of all,

361
31:15.400 --> 31:17.160
I must apologize

362
31:17.800 --> 31:19.720
for how my brother treated you.

363
31:21.480 --> 31:22.560
Yes.

364
31:23.280 --> 31:24.400
And as for my mother,

365
31:26.880 --> 31:29.560
thank you so much. Truly.

366
31:29.800 --> 31:32.640
I can't think of a better way

367
31:32.840 --> 31:34.040
to express my gratitude.

368
31:34.440 --> 31:35.600
Please don't mention it.

369
31:35.600 --> 31:36.800
It's my duty.

370
31:39.640 --> 31:40.640
Song.

371
31:41.120 --> 31:42.320
Hi, Nueng.

372
31:48.400 --> 31:49.760
Sorry to put you through this.

373
31:50.600 --> 31:52.240
It's nothing. Don't worry about it.

374
31:53.640 --> 31:55.200
If you get tired of running the café,

375
31:55.200 --> 31:57.160
you can come back to our company.

376
31:57.160 --> 31:58.880
There's always a position for you.

377
31:59.640 --> 32:00.640
Hmm...

378
32:01.480 --> 32:02.640
I'd rather not.

379
32:02.640 --> 32:03.880
It's not really my strength.

380
32:04.640 --> 32:06.000
But if there's ever a problem,

381
32:06.600 --> 32:08.000
we can sort it out together then.

382
32:13.080 --> 32:14.240
Mom,

383
32:14.600 --> 32:15.760
I'm heading out now.

384
32:16.320 --> 32:17.600
All right.

385
32:19.640 --> 32:21.360
Go get ready.

386
32:21.960 --> 32:23.520
You've got five minutes.

387
32:23.520 --> 32:25.200
We're going out for work.

388
32:25.600 --> 32:26.840
Sorry?

389
32:26.840 --> 32:28.040
Going out for work?

390
32:30.400 --> 32:31.440
Yes, go.

391
32:32.360 --> 32:34.000
Or would you rather go like that?

392
32:35.080 --> 32:36.080
All right.

393
33:05.440 --> 33:06.840
Are you getting in or not?

394
33:06.840 --> 33:08.040
Standing there like a post.

395
33:08.040 --> 33:09.880
Do I have to open the door for you?

396
33:10.080 --> 33:11.080
It's just...

397
33:13.400 --> 33:14.320
What now?

398
33:14.320 --> 33:15.760
Must there be a red carpet

399
33:15.760 --> 33:16.720
before you'll get in?

400
33:49.360 --> 33:50.360
Buckle up.

401
34:01.600 --> 34:02.680
I can do it myself.

402
34:04.080 --> 34:05.040
Give it here.

403
34:19.760 --> 34:21.199
Is spending a day out with me

404
34:21.199 --> 34:22.199
going to kill you?

405
34:23.440 --> 34:24.480
No, it won't.

406
34:26.320 --> 34:27.600
Then why make such a fuss?

407
34:27.920 --> 34:28.960
You're wasting my time.

408
34:29.440 --> 34:30.960
Then what do you want me to do?

409
34:31.239 --> 34:32.199
If I sit in front,

410
34:32.199 --> 34:33.360
I'm afraid you'll scold me.

411
34:33.360 --> 34:34.199
If I sit in back,

412
34:34.199 --> 34:35.520
you'll say I'm acting like the boss.

413
34:35.520 --> 34:37.000
I don't know how to act anymore.

414
34:40.480 --> 34:41.480
Have you ever done

415
34:41.480 --> 34:42.760
anything right?

416
34:45.040 --> 34:49.120
♪ I want to tell you so you'll understand ♪

417
34:49.719 --> 34:53.320
♪ But how much longer ♪

418
34:54.239 --> 34:59.080
♪ Can I keep all these words inside? ♪

419
34:59.600 --> 35:03.320
♪ Every time we meet ♪

420
35:04.200 --> 35:07.360
♪ How can I keep pretending When deep down inside ♪

421
35:07.360 --> 35:10.600
♪ I just want to say it out loud? ♪

422
35:10.600 --> 35:13.840
♪ But the closer we get ♪

423
35:13.840 --> 35:17.960
♪ The more my heart wavers ♪

424
35:18.200 --> 35:22.160
♪ I want to surrender to every voice in my heart ♪

425
35:22.160 --> 35:24.800
♪ But my mouth denies my heart ♪

426
35:24.800 --> 35:28.440
♪ Never speaking the truth ♪

427
35:28.440 --> 35:33.720
♪ Even though everything I do ♪

428
35:33.720 --> 35:36.920
♪ Is telling you I love you ♪

429
35:36.920 --> 35:41.360
♪ I give in every time our eyes meet ♪

430
35:41.360 --> 35:49.120
♪ But I'm unable to show it ♪

431
35:49.400 --> 35:58.400
♪ I want to say "I love you" for once, Just like how I feel ♪

432
36:04.520 --> 36:07.240
♪ But my mouth denies my heart ♪

433
36:07.240 --> 36:10.560
♪ Never speaking the truth ♪

434
36:10.560 --> 36:15.840
♪ Even though everything I do ♪

435
36:15.840 --> 36:19.080
♪ Is telling you I love you ♪

436
36:19.080 --> 36:23.240
♪ I give in every time our eyes meet ♪

437
36:23.480 --> 36:31.520
♪ But I'm unable to show it ♪

438
36:31.520 --> 36:38.720
♪ I want to say "I love you" for once, Just like how I feel ♪

439
36:43.800 --> 36:47.800
♪ But I'm unable to show it ♪

440
36:47.800 --> 36:55.360
♪ I want to say "I love you" for once, Just like how I feel ♪

441
37:08.840 --> 37:09.760
Oh.

442
37:11.800 --> 37:13.240
So annoying!

443
37:13.440 --> 37:15.080
Stay out of my life!

444
37:26.880 --> 37:27.920
Wake up.

445
37:30.880 --> 37:31.960
I brought you here to work,

446
37:31.960 --> 37:33.360
and you're sitting there asleep.

447
37:33.360 --> 37:35.160
I thought you've been through a lot.

448
37:35.160 --> 37:36.400
Have you really?

449
37:37.600 --> 37:38.600
I'm sorry.

450
37:59.040 --> 38:00.040
Ms. Oh?

451
38:00.240 --> 38:01.240
Hello.

452
38:01.960 --> 38:02.960
Is everyone here?

453
38:03.400 --> 38:05.120
Yes, they're all waiting inside.

454
38:05.120 --> 38:06.160
This way, please.

455
38:14.320 --> 38:15.800
That backdrop at the entrance,

456
38:15.800 --> 38:16.920
the one I told you to fix,

457
38:16.920 --> 38:18.080
will it be ready in time?

458
38:18.080 --> 38:19.280
Don't forget to double-check

459
38:19.280 --> 38:20.240
that it'll be ready.

460
38:20.240 --> 38:21.240
Oh!

461
38:22.120 --> 38:23.520
Ms. Song, hello.

462
38:26.240 --> 38:27.600
Go sit and wait over there.

463
38:28.360 --> 38:29.360
Yes.

464
38:43.000 --> 38:45.720
This area will serve as the event stage.

465
38:46.040 --> 38:47.520
The natural scenery in the background

466
38:47.520 --> 38:48.640
will blend in,

467
38:50.080 --> 38:51.640
like in the pictures we sent you.

468
38:51.960 --> 38:53.720
And the area over there

469
38:53.720 --> 38:56.280
will be used to receive the VIP guests.

470
38:57.480 --> 38:58.440
And the floor?

471
38:58.440 --> 39:00.520
Will you add carpet or anything else?

472
39:00.760 --> 39:03.160
We won't lay carpet in this area

473
39:03.160 --> 39:04.240
to keep it consistent

474
39:04.240 --> 39:05.360
with the natural look.

475
39:05.360 --> 39:06.720
But at the front,

476
39:06.720 --> 39:07.920
we'll have carpet

477
39:07.920 --> 39:10.440
for the event guests.

478
39:11.120 --> 39:12.240
For the VIP guests,

479
39:12.240 --> 39:13.760
we'll set up this area

480
39:13.960 --> 39:16.640
as a lounge area where they can relax.

481
39:31.120 --> 39:33.040
Do you have anything to add, Ms. Song?

482
39:33.720 --> 39:35.600
Nothing. You can go ahead as planned.

483
39:35.600 --> 39:36.600
Understood.

484
39:36.960 --> 39:38.400
Please follow what Ms. Song said.

485
39:46.840 --> 39:47.840
No need to see us off.

486
39:47.840 --> 39:49.560
Just handle everything here.

487
39:49.560 --> 39:50.560
Of course.

488
40:06.200 --> 40:07.240
Thank you.

489
40:07.240 --> 40:08.240
Thank you.

490
40:13.840 --> 40:14.920
Eat up.

491
40:16.240 --> 40:17.240
Well...

492
40:39.840 --> 40:41.000
I'm full.

493
40:45.360 --> 40:46.640
I'm going back to work.

494
40:47.280 --> 40:49.000
Whether you eat or not is up to you.

495
40:50.400 --> 40:52.280
And don't even think about taking any home.

496
41:05.040 --> 41:06.320
She ordered so much.

497
41:07.080 --> 41:08.080
What a waste.

498
41:09.040 --> 41:11.040
It'd be nice if Mom and Ong could eat this too.

499
41:53.840 --> 41:54.840
Thank you.

500
42:02.600 --> 42:03.600
Thank you.

501
42:43.400 --> 42:44.400
The bill, please.

502
43:09.760 --> 43:12.480
Hey, you haven't touched your dessert.

503
43:14.560 --> 43:16.280
I gave up dessert a long time ago.

504
43:17.320 --> 43:18.440
Huh?

505
43:47.840 --> 43:49.800
PROFESSOR SMITH

506
43:58.680 --> 43:59.680
Yes, Smith.

507
43:59.920 --> 44:01.760
I heard about what Mr. Sam did yesterday.

508
44:01.760 --> 44:03.000
How are you, Oh?

509
44:05.600 --> 44:06.960
Uh...

510
44:07.200 --> 44:08.440
I'm not hurt anywhere.

511
44:09.160 --> 44:10.520
How about quitting?

512
44:10.800 --> 44:12.120
I'll talk to them

513
44:12.120 --> 44:13.040
about canceling the contract.

514
44:17.200 --> 44:18.280
It's all right.

515
44:18.560 --> 44:19.680
I can still manage.

516
44:20.040 --> 44:21.240
Please don't worry, Smith.

517
44:21.520 --> 44:22.680
Of course I worry.

518
44:23.520 --> 44:24.960
- This matter-- - Smith.

519
44:25.920 --> 44:27.680
Let's talk later, okay?

520
44:27.680 --> 44:28.720
All right.

521
44:30.440 --> 44:32.720
Are you close to getting back?

522
44:33.680 --> 44:34.760
So I can wait and see you.

523
44:35.320 --> 44:36.320
Uh...

524
44:36.800 --> 44:38.960
I'm not sure when it'll be done here.

525
44:39.400 --> 44:40.800
Is there something you need?

526
44:41.280 --> 44:42.360
I brought some éclairs

527
44:42.360 --> 44:43.520
from your usual shop for you.

528
44:44.960 --> 44:46.640
But if you're not finished yet,

529
44:46.920 --> 44:48.240
I'll leave them with Cream.

530
44:48.720 --> 44:49.720
Thank you so much.

531
44:50.160 --> 44:51.240
Then I'll hang up now.

532
44:51.720 --> 44:52.720
Okay.

533
44:53.520 --> 44:54.520
Bye.

534
45:11.720 --> 45:13.280
You're so sweet to Smith.

535
45:13.560 --> 45:15.560
"Smith this. Smith that."

536
45:15.880 --> 45:17.360
When you looked scared of Sam,

537
45:17.360 --> 45:18.800
that was just an act, wasn't it?

538
45:19.120 --> 45:22.040
You're so fake, so phony.

539
45:23.080 --> 45:25.240
- Phony? - Stop acting innocent.

540
45:25.600 --> 45:26.680
Get out!

541
45:27.640 --> 45:28.800
What's wrong with you?

542
45:29.040 --> 45:30.240
I said get out!

543
46:20.640 --> 46:21.760
Hey.

544
46:22.360 --> 46:23.360
You're back.

545
46:25.960 --> 46:27.400
What's wrong?

546
46:27.400 --> 46:29.080
Why are you drenched in sweat?

547
46:29.640 --> 46:30.880
And your face is pale too.

548
46:32.240 --> 46:34.360
I walked back. There weren't any cars.

549
46:35.960 --> 46:37.400
Why didn't you call me?

550
46:40.920 --> 46:42.440
Dr. Smith left some sweets for you.

551
46:42.760 --> 46:43.840
I put them on the counter

552
46:43.840 --> 46:44.840
in the main kitchen.

553
46:45.480 --> 46:46.520
Thanks, Cream.

554
46:50.200 --> 46:51.440
Who's that?

555
46:51.440 --> 46:52.480
I'll go check first.

556
47:19.720 --> 47:20.720
Oops.

557
47:21.320 --> 47:22.240
Sorry.

558
47:22.840 --> 47:24.200
Do you have to go this far?

559
47:24.720 --> 47:26.480
Do you have a problem with it?

560
47:27.360 --> 47:28.600
If you hate me this much,

561
47:29.240 --> 47:30.240
why keep me here

562
47:30.240 --> 47:31.480
as your eyesore?

563
47:31.880 --> 47:32.960
I don't understand.

564
47:33.400 --> 47:34.720
What do you want from me?

565
47:35.080 --> 47:36.680
What I want is my own business.

566
47:37.840 --> 47:38.920
A hired hand

567
47:38.920 --> 47:40.320
has no right to ask me that.

568
47:43.480 --> 47:44.560
Then I apologize.

569
47:52.360 --> 47:53.360
Oh?

570
47:55.080 --> 47:55.920
Oh!

571
47:55.920 --> 47:56.920
Oh!

572
47:57.440 --> 47:58.120
Oh!

573
47:58.120 --> 47:59.360
What's wrong, Oh?

574
47:59.360 --> 48:00.160
Oh!

575
48:20.520 --> 48:22.200
I should take Oh to the hospital.

576
48:22.200 --> 48:23.440
No need.

577
48:23.600 --> 48:25.480
I can take care of my people.

578
48:26.280 --> 48:27.880
You made me this way.

579
48:27.880 --> 48:28.920
Don't you think

580
48:28.920 --> 48:29.800
you should take responsibility?

581
48:29.800 --> 48:31.240
Last night you slept with one person,

582
48:31.240 --> 48:32.800
and today you went off with another.

583
48:32.800 --> 48:34.760
So, did you get your fill?

584
48:35.840 --> 48:37.320
I thought the two of us

585
48:37.320 --> 48:38.280
could go back to how we were.

586
48:38.280 --> 48:40.080
What are you trying to come back to

587
48:40.080 --> 48:41.320
when there's nothing left between us?

588
48:46.040 --> 48:48.560
♪ But my mouth denies my heart ♪

589
48:48.560 --> 48:52.240
♪ Never speaking the truth ♪

590
48:52.240 --> 48:57.440
♪ Even though everything I do ♪

591
48:57.440 --> 49:00.640
♪ Is telling you I love you ♪

592
49:00.640 --> 49:05.160
♪ I give in every time our eyes meet ♪

593
49:05.160 --> 49:13.280
♪ But I'm unable to show it ♪

594
49:13.280 --> 49:19.960
♪ I want to say "I love you" for once, Just like how I feel ♪

595
